Generic single-database configuration for Alembic.

## Usage

Generate a new migration (autogenerate):
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"

Apply all migrations:
    alembic upgrade head

Rollback one migration:
    alembic downgrade -1

View current revision:
    alembic current

View migration history:
    alembic history

## Initial Setup for Existing Database

If the database already has tables created (via create_all), stamp it:
    alembic stamp head

This marks the database as being at the current migration state without
running any migrations.
